    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be ðon ðe ful friþiaþ.] [Ld] Gif hwa ðis oferhebbe ⁊ his að ⁊ his wæd brece, ðe eal ðeod geseald hæfð, bete swa dómboc tæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone neglects this and breaks his oath and his pledge, [an oath and pledge] which the whole nation has given, he shall pay such compensation as the written laws declare.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf hwa ðis oferhebbe ⁊ his að ⁊ his wed brece, ðe heal ðeod geseald hæfð, bete swa domboc tæce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
